246	<!-- 3 · The route -->
247	<section class="scene" data-title="The route" data-short="Route">
248	  <div class="head">
249	    <p class="eyebrow">The route</p>
250	    <h2>Moneo never opens a door</h2>
251	    <p class="lede">It still listens only on <code>127.0.0.1</code>. Tailscale is the one thing that accepts the connection, and only from your own devices.</p>
252	  </div>
253	  <div class="pipe" style="margin-top:6px">
254	    <div class="card" data-s="1"><span class="pill p-brand">Phone</span><h3>Your address</h3><p>The browser or home-screen icon opens <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere">https://your-pc.<wbr>your-tailnet.<wbr>ts.net</code>.</p></div>
255	    <div class="arrow" data-s="2">→</div>
256	    <div class="card" data-s="2"><span class="pill">Tailscale app</span><h3>Encrypted tunnel</h3><p>A WireGuard tunnel from the phone to the computer, from any network.</p></div>
257	    <div class="arrow" data-s="3">→</div>
258	    <div class="card" data-s="3"><span class="pill">Tailscale Serve</span><h3>HTTPS on your computer</h3><p>Ends HTTPS there and forwards to Moneo, keeping the address the phone asked for.</p></div>
259	    <div class="arrow" data-s="4">→</div>
260	    <div class="card" data-s="4" style="border-color:var(--brand)"><span class="pill p-brand">Moneo</span><h3>127.0.0.1:3000</h3><p>Handles the request like any other, and pages use the address the device asked for.</p></div>
261	    <div class="arrow" data-s="5">→</div>
262	    <div class="card" data-s="5"><span class="pill p-blue">Docker</span><h3>127.0.0.1:54321</h3><p>Only Moneo's server talks to the database and file storage.</p></div>
263	  </div>
264	  <div class="grid g3" style="margin-top:26px">
265	    <div class="card" data-s="6"><span class="pill p-brand">Works anywhere</span><h3>No router changes</h3><p>Home Wi-Fi or mobile data. No ports forwarded, no public address.</p></div>
266	    <div class="card" data-s="6"><span class="pill p-brand">Real HTTPS</span><h3>The microphone is allowed</h3><p>Browsers only allow voice calls on secure pages, and installing to the home screen works best there too.</p></div>
267	    <div class="card" data-s="6"><span class="pill p-brand">Streaming</span><h3>Replies still arrive live</h3><p>Measured through Serve: each line of a test stream arrived within a few milliseconds.</p></div>
268	  </div>
269	  <p class="tag-line" data-s="7">The one command behind all of it: <code style="font-size:19px">tailscale serve --bg --https=443 http://127.0.0.1:3000</code></p>
270	</section>
